per_rank_text:
While active, casting a melee ability that deals damage will cause a Sweeping Strike, dealing 40% weapon damage to 5 nearby enemies, further increased by attack power. Lasts 10 sec. 

@ext:Can't be active at the same time as Blade Flurry.

This ability is usable while shapeshifted.:ext@

Increases your melee attack speed by 20%. In addition, attacks strike an additional nearby opponent. Lasts 20 sec.

@ext:Can't be active at the same time as Sweeping Strikes.
 
This ability is usable while shapeshifted.:ext@

Unleashes the energy of a Seal spell to judge an enemy for 20 sec, giving each attack a chance to restore 2% of the attacker's base mana. 

@ext:Refer to individual Seals for additional Judgement effect.:ext@

@ext:Only one Judgement per Paladin can be active at any one time.:ext@

Strengthens you with the presence of blood, increasing damage by 2% and heals you for 1% of your damage dealt.

@ext:Only one Presence may be active at a time.:ext@

@ext:Heals up to a maximum of 5% of your health per hit.:ext@

Increases the damage of your Judgement, Crusader Strike, Execution Sentence and Divine Storm abilities by 3%. 

Dealing direct damage with Holy and Physical abilities or spells has a 50% chance to reduce the cast time of your next Flash of Light or Exorcism by 33%. 

@ext:This effect has a 6 second cooldown.:ext@

Increases the damage of your Judgement, Crusader Strike, Execution Sentence and Divine Storm abilities by 6%. 

Dealing direct damage with Holy and Physical abilities or spells has a 50% chance to reduce the cast time of your next Flash of Light or Exorcism by 66%. 

@ext:This effect has a 6 second cooldown.:ext@

Increases the damage of your Judgement, Crusader Strike, Execution Sentence and Divine Storm abilities by 9%.

Dealing direct damage with Holy and Physical abilities or spells has a 50% chance to reduce the cast time of your next Flash of Light or Exorcism by 100%. 

@ext:This effect has a 6 second cooldown.:ext@

Sacrifice your physical self, reducing Physical damage dealt by 35% to empower your Crusader Strike and Divine Storm, causing them to deal additional Holy damage and gain additional Holy power scaling.

This effect can be toggled on and off.

@ext:Reduces physical damage versus players by 30%.:ext@
